<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ECC" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Eklezyas</para>
  <para style="toc1">EKLEZYAS YO</para>
  <para style="toc2">Eklezyas</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ekl</para>
  <para style="mt1">EKLEZYAS YO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ECC 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 1:1" />Pawòl <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 1:12">Ekl 1:12</ref></char></note>predikatè a, fis a David la, Wa Jérusalem. <verse eid="ECC 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 1:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 39:5-6">Sòm 39:5-6</ref></char></note>“Vanite sou vanite”, predikatè la di: “Vanite sou vanite! Tout se vanite.” <verse eid="ECC 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 1:3" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:11">Ekl 2:11</ref> </char></note>Ki avantaj yon nonm gen nan tout travay ke li fè anba solèy la? <verse eid="ECC 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 1:4" />Yon jenerasyon ale e yon jenerasyon vini; men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:5">Sòm 104:5</ref></char></note>tè a rete pou tout tan. <verse eid="ECC 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 1:5" />Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 19:6">Sòm 19:6</ref></char></note>solèy la leve e solèy la kouche; konsa li kouri al jwenn plas li pou li leve la ankò. <verse eid="ECC 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 1:6" />Van an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 11:5">Ekl 11:5</ref></char></note>soufle vè sid, vire kote nò e kontinye vire fè wonn li. Sou menm kous vire won an, li retounen ankò. <verse eid="ECC 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 1:7" />Tout rivyè yo desann vè lanmè a; sepandan li pa vin plen. Nan plas kote rivyè yo koule a, se la yo koule ankò. <verse eid="ECC 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 1:8" />Tout bagay sa yo fatigan; lòm pa kapab menm eksplike sa. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 27:20">Pwov 27:20</ref></char></note>Zye pa satisfè ak wè, ni zòrèy ak tande. <verse eid="ECC 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 1:9" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 1:10">Ekl 1:10</ref></char></note>Sa ki te ye, se sa ki va ye e sa ki te konn fèt, se sa k ap fèt. Konsa, nanpwen anyen ki nèf anba syèl la. <verse eid="ECC 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 1:10" />Èske gen yon bagay sou sila a nou ta kab di: “Men sa a nèf”? Deja, li te la depi syèk ki te ekoule avan nou yo. <verse eid="ECC 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 1:11" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:16">Ekl 2:16</ref></char></note>Nanpwen memwa a ansyen bagay yo, ni anplis a sila k ap vini pita, pami sila ki vini apre yo.<verse eid="ECC 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 1:12" />Mwen menm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 1:1">Ekl 1:1</ref> </char></note>predikatè a, te sèvi kon wa sou Israël nan Jérusalem. <verse eid="ECC 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 1:13" />Mwen te konsantre tout refleksyon mwen pou chache e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:10-11">Ekl 3:10-11</ref></char></note>egzamine sou sajès tout sa ki te konn fèt anba syèl la. Sa se yon gwo tach lou ke Bondye te bay fis a lòm yo pou l ta aflije yo. <verse eid="ECC 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 1:14" />Mwen te wè tout zèv ki te fèt anba solèy la e, men vwala, tout se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:11-17">Ekl 2:11-17</ref></char></note>vanite e chache kouri dèyè van. <verse eid="ECC 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 1:15" />Sa ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 7:13">Ekl 7:13</ref></char></note>kwochi p ap ka drese e sa ki manke p ap ka konte. <verse eid="ECC 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 1:16" />Mwen te di a pwòp tèt mwen: “Men gade, mwen te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:12">I Wa 3:12</ref></char></note>sajès vin grandi e ogmante plis pase tout lòt wa ki te sou Jérusalem avan mwen yo. Wi, panse mwen te obsève anpil richès ak sajès avèk konesans.” <verse eid="ECC 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 1:17" />Mwen te dirije panse mwen pou konnen sajès e pou konnen sa ki ensanse ak sa ki foli nèt. Konsa, mwen te vin wè ke sa osi se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 1:14">Ekl 1:14</ref> </char></note>chache kouri dèyè van. <verse eid="ECC 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 1:18" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:23">Ekl 2:23</ref></char></note>nan anpil sajès gen anpil tristès, e nan anpil konesans gen anpil doulè.<verse eid="ECC 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ECC 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 2:1" />Mwen te di nan tèt mwen: “Vini koulye a, mwen va teste ou ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 7:4">Ekl 7:4</ref></char></note>plezi. Pou sa, fè kè ou kontan.” Epi sa osi se te vanite. <verse eid="ECC 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 2:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 14:13">Pwov 14:13</ref></char></note>Mwen te di de afè ri, “Sa se foli,” e de plezi, “Kisa l ap akonpli?”<verse eid="ECC 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 2:3" />Mwen te fè ankèt ak panse m kòman pou eksite kò m ak diven pandan panse m ap gide m ak sajès ak jan pou kenbe foli, jiskaske mwen ta kapab wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:24">Ekl 2:24</ref> </char></note>sa ki bon ki genyen pou fis a lòm yo fè anba syèl la pandan ti kras ane ke y ap viv yo. <verse eid="ECC 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 2:4" />Mwen te agrandi zèv mwen yo. Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:1-12">I Wa 7:1-12</ref></char></note>bati kay pou mwen; mwen te plante chan rezen pou mwen. <verse eid="ECC 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 2:5" />Mwen te fè jaden ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 2:8">Né 2:8</ref> </char></note>bèl plas pou tèt mwen e mwen te plante ladann yo tout kalite pye fwi. <verse eid="ECC 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 2:6" />Mwen te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 2:14">Né 2:14</ref></char></note>gwo basen dlo pou tèt mwen pou awoze yon forè bwa ki t ap grandi. <verse eid="ECC 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 2:7" />Mwen te achte esklav, ni mal ni femèl e mwen te genyen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:14">Jen 14:14</ref></char></note>ki te fèt lakay mwen. Anplis mwen te genyen bann mouton avèk twoupo pi gran pase tout wa ki te Jérusalem avan m yo. <verse eid="ECC 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 2:8" />Anplis, mwen te ranmase ajan ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:28">I Wa 9:28</ref> </char></note>lò pou pwòp tèt mwen ansanm ak trezò a wa yo ak pwovens pa yo. Mwen te founi pou pwòp tèt mwen chantè, ni mal, ni femèl, e tout plezi a lòm yo—anpil konkibin. <verse eid="ECC 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 2:9" />Epi mwen te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:25">I Kwo 29:25</ref> </char></note>gran, pi gran pase tout wa ki te avan m Jérusalem yo. Konsa, sajès mwen te kanpe avè m. <verse eid="ECC 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 2:10" />Tout sa ke zye m te anvi, mwen pa t refize yo. Mwen pa t refize kè m okenn plezi li te vle, paske kè m te kontan akoz tout zèv mwen yo, e sa se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:22">Ekl 3:22</ref> </char></note>rekonpans pou tout travay mwen yo. <verse eid="ECC 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 2:11" />Konsa, mwen te konsidere tout zèv men m te konn fè yo, avèk travay ke m te fòse fè yo, men gade byen, tout te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 1:14">Ekl 1:14</ref></char></note>vanite ak kouri dèyè van, e pa t gen okenn avantaj anba solèy la.<verse eid="ECC 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 2:12" />Konsa mwen te vire <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 1:17">Ekl 1:17</ref></char></note>konsidere sajès, afè moun ensanse menm ak foli; paske se kisa yon nonm ki swiv wa sila a ka fè, sinon sa ki te konn fèt deja? <verse eid="ECC 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 2:13" />Epi mwen te wè ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 7:11-19">Ekl 7:11-19</ref></char></note>sajès toujou genyen sou vanite, tankou limyè genyen sou tenèb. <verse eid="ECC 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 2:14" />Zye a mesye saj la anndan tèt li; men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:11">I Jn 2:11</ref></char></note>moun ensanse a mache nan tenèb. Sepandan, mwen konnen ke se menm desten ki va rive yo tou de. <verse eid="ECC 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 2:15" />Konsa, mwen rive di tèt mwen: “Kon desten a moun ensanse a, se konsa l ap rive m. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 6:8-11">Ekl 6:8-11</ref></char></note>Alò, poukisa mwen te fòse fè anpil sajès?” Alò, pou sa mwen te di tèt mwen: “Sa, anplis, se vanite.” <verse eid="ECC 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 2:16" />Paske nanpwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 1:11">Ekl 1:11</ref></char></note>okenn memwa k ap sonje nonm saj la, menm jan pou ensanse a, akoz nan tout jou k ap vini yo, tout moun va bliye yo nèt. Epi konsa, nonm saj la ak ensanse a mouri tou de!<verse eid="ECC 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 2:17" />Pou sa, mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 4:2-3">Ekl 4:2-3</ref></char></note>rayi lavi, paske travay ki te fèt anba syèl la te yon doulè pou mwen; paske tout bagay se kòve ak kouri dèyè van. <verse eid="ECC 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 2:18" />Konsa, mwen te rayi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 39:6">Sòm 39:6</ref></char></note>tout fwi a travay mwen yo, pou sila mwen te fè efò anba solèy la; paske mwen ap oblije kite li bay nonm nan k ap swiv mwen an. <verse eid="ECC 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 2:19" />Epi se kilès ki konnen si li va saj, oswa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:13">I Wa 12:13</ref></char></note>moun fou? Malgre li va gen kontwòl sou tout fwi travay mwen. Pou sila mwen te fòse fè ak sajès yo, anba solèy la. Sa, anplis, se vanite.<verse eid="ECC 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 2:20" />Pou sa, mwen te pèdi espwa nèt a tout fwi a zèv mwen pou sila mwen te travay anba solèy la. <verse eid="ECC 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 2:21" />Kote ki genyen yon nonm ki te travay ak sajès, konesans ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 4:4">Ekl 4:4</ref></char></note>kapasite, alò, li va kite eritaj li a yon moun ki pa t travay pou yo. Sa osi se vanite ak yon gwo mal. <verse eid="ECC 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 2:22" />Paske se kisa ke yon nonm jwenn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 4:4">Ekl 4:4</ref></char></note>pou tout travay li, nan efò ke li te fòse fè anba solèy la? <verse eid="ECC 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 2:23" />Paske tout jou li yo, travay li plen ak doulè ak chagren; menm nan lannwit tèt li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 127:2">Sòm 127:2</ref></char></note>pa jwenn repo. Sa tou, se vanite. <verse eid="ECC 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 2:24" />Nanpwen anyen pi bon pou yon nonm, ke manje, bwè, e di tèt li, ke travay li a bon. Sa a mwen konn wè tou, ke li sòti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:13">Ekl 3:13</ref></char></note>nan men Bondye. <verse eid="ECC 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 2:25" />Paske se kilès ki ka manje, e kilès ki ka jwenn plezi li plis pase m? <verse eid="ECC 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 2:26" />Paske a yon nonm ki bon nan zye Bondye, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 32:8">Job 32:8</ref></char></note>Li te bay sajès, konesans ak lajwa; men a pechè a, Li te bay tach ranmase ak rasanble pou li kab bay a sila ki bon nan zye Bondye a. Sa anplis se vanite ak kouri dèyè van.<verse eid="ECC 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ECC 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 3:1" />Gen yon lè apwente pou tout bagay. Epi gen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:17">Ekl 3:17</ref></char></note>tan pou chak sa ki rive anba syèl la—<verse eid="ECC 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 3:2" />Yon tan pou ne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:2">yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 14:5">Job 14:5</ref></char></note>tan pou mouri;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:2">yon tan pou plante,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:2">ak yon tan pou dechouke</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:2">sa ki plante a.<verse eid="ECC 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 3:3" />Yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:5">Jen 9:5</ref></char></note>tan pou touye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:3">e yon tan pou geri;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:3">yon tan pou demoli</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:3">e yon tan pou bati.<verse eid="ECC 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 3:4" />Yon tan pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:15">Wo 12:15</ref></char></note>kriye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:4">e yon tan pou ri;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:4">yon tan pou fè dèy</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:4">e yon tan pou danse.<verse eid="ECC 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 3:5" />Yon tan pou voye wòch</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:5">e yon tan pou ranmase wòch;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:5">yon tan pou anbrase</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:5">e yon tan pou evite anbrase.<verse eid="ECC 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 3:6" />Yon tan pou chache</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:6">e yon tan pou pèdi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:6">Yon tan pou konsève,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:6">e yon tan pou jete.<verse eid="ECC 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 3:7" />Yon tan pou chire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:7">e yon tan pou koude;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:7">yon tan pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:13">Am 5:13</ref></char></note>rete an silans</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:7">e yon tan pou pale.<verse eid="ECC 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 3:8" />Yon tan pou fè lanmou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:8">e yon tan pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 101:3">Sòm 101:3</ref></char></note>rayisman;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:8">yon tan pou fè lagè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:8">e yon tan pou fè lapè.<verse eid="ECC 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 3:9" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 1:3">Ekl 1:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ki avantaj ouvriye a genyen nan tout efò ke li fè yo? <verse eid="ECC 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 3:10" />Mwen te wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 1:13">Ekl 1:13</ref></char></note>tach ke Bondye te bay a fis a lòm yo, avèk sila yo okipe tèt yo. <verse eid="ECC 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 3:11" />Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:31">Jen 1:31</ref></char></note>fè tout bagay bon nan tan li. Anplis, Li te mete letènite nan kè yo, pou ke lòm pa ka fin konprann travay Bondye te fè a soti nan kòmansman jis rive nan lafen. <verse eid="ECC 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 3:12" />Mwen konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:24">Ekl 2:24</ref></char></note>pa gen pi bon bagay pou yo ta fè pase rejwi e fè byen pandan yo gen lavi a. <verse eid="ECC 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 3:13" />Anplis, pou tout moun ki manje ak bwè yo wè bonte Bondye nan tout travay li yo—se don Bondye sa ye. <verse eid="ECC 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 3:14" />Mwen konnen ke tout sa Bondye fè va dire pou tout tan. Nanpwen anyen pou mete sou li e nanpwen anyen pou retire sou li, paske Bondye te tèlman travay pou lòm ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 5:7">Ekl 5:7</ref></char></note>gen lakrent Li. <verse eid="ECC 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 3:15" />Sa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 1:9">Ekl 1:9</ref></char></note>ki egziste, te la deja e sa ki va ye, te ye deja. Konsa, Bondye chache jwenn sa ki fin pase.<verse eid="ECC 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 3:16" />Anplis, mwen te wè anba solèy la ke nan plas lajistis gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 4:1">Ekl 4:1</ref></char></note>mechanste; e nan plas ladwati gen mechanste. <verse eid="ECC 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 3:17" />Mwen te di a pwòp tèt mwen: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:25">Jen 18:25</ref></char></note>“Bondye va jije ni sila ki dwat la, ni sila ki mechan an,” paske gen yon tan pou chak zèv ak chak bagay. <verse eid="ECC 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 3:18" />Mwen te di pwòp tèt mwen selon fis a lòm yo: “Anverite, Bondye te fè yo pase a leprèv pou yo ta wè ke se tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 49:12-20">Sòm 49:12-20</ref></char></note>bèt ke yo ye.” <verse eid="ECC 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 3:19" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 49:12">Sòm 49:12</ref></char></note>Paske desten a fis a lòm yo ak desten a bèt yo se menm. Tankou youn mouri, konsa lòt la mouri. Anverite, yo tout gen menm souf la, e nanpwen avantaj pou lòm sou bèt yo, paske tout se vanite. <verse eid="ECC 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 3:20" />Tout ale menm kote. Tout te sòti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:19">Jen 3:19</ref></char></note>pousyè a, e tout ap retounen nan pousyè a. <verse eid="ECC 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 3:21" />Se kilès ki ka konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 12:7">Ekl 12:7</ref></char></note>souf a lòm monte anwo e souf a bèt yo desann anba tè?<verse eid="ECC 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 3:22" />Mwen te wè ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:24">Ekl 2:24</ref></char></note>nanpwen anyen ki pi bon pou lòm ta fè pase fè kè kontan nan tout sa li fè, paske se konsa sò a tonbe pou li. Paske se kilès ki ka fè l wè sa ki va vin rive apre li?<verse eid="ECC 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ECC 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 4:1" />Konsa, mwen te gade ankò sou tout zèv k ap oprime moun anba solèy la. Epi gade byen, mwen te wè dlo nan zye a oprime yo, e yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 16:7">Jr 16:7</ref></char></note>pa t jwenn pèsòn pou bay yo soulajman. Sou kote a sila ki t ap oprime yo, te gen gwo pouvwa; men, yo pa t jwenn pèsòn pou bay yo soulajman. <verse eid="ECC 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 4:2" />Pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:11-26">Job 3:11-26</ref></char></note>mwen te felisite tout sila ki fin mouri deja yo, olye sila k ap viv yo. <verse eid="ECC 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 4:3" />Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:11-26">Job 3:11-26</ref></char></note>pi beni pase tou de nan yo se sila ki pa t janm egziste a, ki pa t wè tout mechanste ki konn fèt anba solèy la. <verse eid="ECC 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 4:4" />Mwen konn wè tout zèv ak tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:21">Ekl 2:21</ref></char></note>metye ki konn fèt, fèt akoz lanvi antre yon nonm ak vwazen li. Sa anplis se vanite ak fè lachas dèyè van.<verse eid="ECC 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 4:5" />Moun ensanse a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 6:10">Pwov 6:10</ref></char></note>pliye men l e manje pwòp chè li. <verse eid="ECC 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 4:6" />Yon men plen repo se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 15:16-17">Pwov 15:16-17</ref></char></note>miyò ke de ponyèt plen travay k ap fè kòve dèyè van an.<verse eid="ECC 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 4:7" />Konsa mwen te gade ankò sou vanite anba solèy la. <verse eid="ECC 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 4:8" />Te gen yon sèten mesye san fanmi ki pa t genyen ni fis, ni frè. Sepandan, nan travay li, pa t gen repo menm. Anverite, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 27:20">Pwov 27:20</ref></char></note>zye li pa t janm satisfè ak richès, men li pa t janm kon mande: “Epi pou ki moun m ap travay e prive tèt mwen de plezi konsa?” Sa, anplis se vanite, e sa se yon kòve ki plen doulè.<verse eid="ECC 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 4:9" />De moun pi bon pase yon sèl, paske y ap jwenn bon benefis pou travay yo. <verse eid="ECC 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 4:10" />Paske si youn nan yo ta tonbe, lòt la va leve pare li. Men malè a sila ki tonbe lè nanpwen lòt pou fè l leve a. <verse eid="ECC 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 4:11" />Anplis, si de moun kouche ansanm, youn chofe lòt; men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:1-4">I Wa 1:1-4</ref></char></note>ki jan yon sèl moun ta ka chofe? <verse eid="ECC 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 4:12" />Anplis, si youn ka venk sila ki sèl la, de ka reziste ak li; epi yon kòd fèt ak twa fil ap mal pou chire.<verse eid="ECC 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 4:13" />Yon jennjan ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 7:19">Ekl 7:19</ref></char></note>malere men ki gen sajès, miyò pase yon ansyen wa ki ensanse, e ki pa konn resevwa konsèy. <verse eid="ECC 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 4:14" />Paske li te sòti nan prizon pou vin wa, malgre li te fèt malere nan wayòm li an. <verse eid="ECC 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 4:15" />Mwen te wè tout sa k ap viv anba solèy la kouri bò kote dezyèm jennjan ki ranplase li an. <verse eid="ECC 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 4:16" />Pèp la p ap janm fini; tout moun ki te avan yo, ni sila k ap vini pita yo p ap kontan avèk li. Anverite, sa osi se vanite ak kouri dèyè van.<verse eid="ECC 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ECC 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 5:1" />Veye pa ou yo pandan w ap desann lakay Bondye a, e vin toupre pou koute olye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:22">I Sam 15:22</ref></char></note>ofri sakrifis a moun ensanse yo. Paske yo pa konnen ke se mal y ap fè. <verse eid="ECC 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 5:2" />Pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 20:25">Pwov 20:25</ref></char></note>fè vit avèk pawòl ou, ni kouri twò vit pou soulve yon refleksyon devan prezans Bondye. Paske Bondye nan syèl la, e ou sou tè a; pou sa pa kite pawòl ou yo vin anpil. <verse eid="ECC 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 5:3" />Paske rèv la vin akonpli ak anpil travay; e vwa a yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 11:2">Job 11:2</ref></char></note>moun ensanse, ak anpil pawòl. <verse eid="ECC 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 5:4" />Lè ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 30:2">Nonb 30:2</ref></char></note>fè yon ve a Bondye, pa fè reta pou peye l; paske li pa pran plezi nan moun ki plen foli. Peye sa ou te pwomèt la! <verse eid="ECC 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 5:5" />Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 20:25">Pwov 20:25</ref></char></note>pi bon pou pa fè ve pase fè yon ve pou pa peye l. <verse eid="ECC 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 5:6" />Pa kite pawòl ou yo fè ou fè peche, e pa di nan prezans a mesaje Bondye a ke ou te mal pale. Poukisa Bondye ta dwe vin fache akoz vwa ou, e detwi tout zèv men ou yo? <verse eid="ECC 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 5:7" />Paske nan fè anpil rèv ak nan anpil pawòl, gen yon gwo vid. Pito <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:14">Ekl 3:14</ref></char></note>gen lakrent Bondye.<verse eid="ECC 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 5:8" />Si ou wè malere a vin oprime e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:18">Éz 18:18</ref> </char></note>pa gen lajistis nan pwovens yo, pa sezi lè ou wè l. Paske gen chèf sou chèf, e gen chèf pi wo sou yo. <verse eid="ECC 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 5:9" />Apre tout bagay, yon wa ki kiltive latè se yon avantaj pou peyi a.<verse eid="ECC 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 5:10" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 1:8">Ekl 1:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sila ki renmen lajan an p ap satisfè ak lajan; ni sila ki renmen richès la ak sa li reyisi. Sa anplis se vanite. <verse eid="ECC 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 5:11" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:9">Ekl 2:9</ref></char></note>Lè bon bagay ogmante, sila ki manje yo ogmante. Konsa, pa gen lòt avantaj pou mèt yo, sof ke kanpe veye?<verse eid="ECC 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 5:12" />Dòmi a ouvriye a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:24">Pwov 3:24</ref></char></note>dous, kit li manje piti oswa anpil; men vant plen a moun rich la p ap kite l dòmi.<verse eid="ECC 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 5:13" />Gen yon gwo mechanste ke m konn wè anba solèy la: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 6:2">Ekl 6:2</ref></char></note>richès sere pa mèt li jiskaske li rive donmaje pwòp tèt li. <verse eid="ECC 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 5:14" />Lè richès sa yo te pèdi akoz yon move envestiman, e li vin papa a yon fis; alò, nanpwen anyen pou ba li. <verse eid="ECC 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 5:15" />Kon li soti nan vant manman li toutouni an; se konsa li va retounen jan li te sòti a. Li p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 49:17">Sòm 49:17</ref></char></note>pote anyen nan men l kon fwi travay li. <verse eid="ECC 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 5:16" />Sa anplis se yon gwo malè—menm jan yon nonm fèt la, se konsa l ap mouri. Alò, kote avantaj pou sila k ap travay di nan van an? <verse eid="ECC 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 5:17" />Pandan tout lavi li, li manje nan tenèb ak gwo chagren, maladi ak kòlè.<verse eid="ECC 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 5:18" />Men sa mwen konn wè ki bon e ki pwòp pou moun fè a: manje, bwè e fè kè kontan nan tout travay ke li fè anba solèy la, pandan ti tan kout ke Bondye ba li a. Paske se sa ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:10">Ekl 2:10</ref></char></note>rekonpans li. <verse eid="ECC 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 5:19" />Anplis, menm jan pou tout moun ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 1:12">II Kwo 1:12</ref></char></note>Bondye te bay richès ak byen yo, anplis Li te bay li kapasite pou manje ladann yo e rejwi nan travay li. Sa se don Bondye a. <verse eid="ECC 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 5:20" />Konsa, se pa souvan ke moun nan va konsidere ane lavi li yo, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:25">Egz 23:25</ref></char></note>Bondye kenbe l okipe tout tan ak rejwisans kè li.<verse eid="ECC 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ECC 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 6:1" />Gen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 5:13">Ekl 5:13</ref></char></note>mal ke m konn wè anba syèl la e ki gaye patou pami lòm— <verse eid="ECC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 6:2" />Yon nonm ke Bondye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:13">I Wa 3:13</ref></char></note>fin bay richès, byen ak lonè, jiskaske nanm li pa manke anyen nan tout sa ke li dezire. Men Bondye pa kite li manje ladann, paske yon etranje ap jwe benefis yo. Sa se vanite ak gwo malè.<verse eid="ECC 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 6:3" />Si yon nonm fè yon santèn timoun e viv anpil ane, malgre fòs kantite ke yo kapab ye, men nanm li pa janm satisfè ak bon bagay, e li pa menm ka fè yon bon antèman; alò, mwen di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:16">Job 3:16</ref></char></note>“Pito li te sòti kon foskouch nan vant li.” <verse eid="ECC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 6:4" />Paske li parèt an ven e non li vin kouvri nan fènwa. <verse eid="ECC 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 6:5" />Li pa janm wè solèy la, e li p ap janm konnen anyen; li pi bon pase lòt la. <verse eid="ECC 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 6:6" />Menm si lòt la viv pandan mil ane de fwa e pa rejwi de bon bagay—èske se pa tout moun ki ale menm kote a? <verse eid="ECC 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 6:7" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 16:26">Pwov 16:26</ref></char></note>Tout travay a lòm se pou satisfè bouch li; malgre sa, apeti li pa janm satisfè. <verse eid="ECC 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 6:8" />Paske, se ki lavantaj yon nonm saj genyen sou yon moun san konprann? Ki lavantaj malere a genyen nan konnen jan pou mache devan sila ki vivan yo? <verse eid="ECC 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 6:9" />Sa ke zye wè pi bon pase sa ke nanm dezire. Sa tou, se san rezon ak kouri dèyè van. <verse eid="ECC 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 6:10" />Tout sa ki egziste te gen non deja, e yo tout konnen sa ke lòm nan ye; paske li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:32">Job 9:32</ref></char></note>pa ka goumen ak sila ki pi fò pase l. <verse eid="ECC 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 6:11" />Paske, gen anpil pawòl ki ogmante vanite. Alò, se ki lavantaj pou yon nonm? <verse eid="ECC 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 6:12" />Paske kilès ki konnen sa ki bon pou yon nonm pandan lavi li, pandan ti kras ane lavi li ki san rezon an? Li va pase yo tankou lonbraj. Paske se kilès ki ka di <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:22">Ekl 3:22</ref></char></note>sa k ap rive apre li anba solèy la?<verse eid="ECC 6:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ECC 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 7:1" />Yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 22:1">Pwov 22:1</ref></char></note>bon non pi bon pase yon pomad swa, e jou mouri pi bon pase jou nou te ne a. <verse eid="ECC 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 7:2" />Li pi bon pou ale nan kay k ap fè dèy pase nan kay k ap fè fèt; paske se konsa ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:14-16">Ekl 2:14-16</ref></char></note>chak moun va fini, e sila ki vivan an pran sa a kè. <verse eid="ECC 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 7:3" />Tristès pi bon pase ri; paske lè figi moun nan tris, kè la vin pi bon. <verse eid="ECC 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 7:4" />Panse a saj la anndan lakay k ap fè dèy; men panse a san konprann nan kay plezi. <verse eid="ECC 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 7:5" />Li pi bon pou koute repwòch a yon nonm saj pase pou yon moun ta koute chanson a moun san konprann yo. <verse eid="ECC 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 7:6" />Paske tankou bwa pikan sèch pete nan dife; se konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:2">Ekl 2:2</ref></char></note>lè yon nonm ensanse ap ri; epi sa anplis se vanite. <verse eid="ECC 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 7:7" />Paske chantay ka fè yon nonm saj vin fou, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:8">Egz 23:8</ref> </char></note>lajan anba tab fè kè vin konwonpi. <verse eid="ECC 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 7:8" />Lè yon bagay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 7:1">Ekl 7:1</ref></char></note>fin fèt, li pi bon pase lè l te kòmanse a.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ECC 7:8">Pasyans nan lespri pi bon pase awogans lespri a. <verse eid="ECC 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 7:9" />Pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 14:7">Pwov 14:7</ref></char></note>chofè kè ou pou vin fache; paske fache rete nan kè a moun ensanse. <verse eid="ECC 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 7:10" />Pa di: “Poukisa jou lontan yo te pi bon pase jodi a”? Paske nanpwen sajès nan kesyon sa a.<verse eid="ECC 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 7:11" />Sajès ansanm ak eritaj bon, e se yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 8:10-11">Pwov 8:10-11</ref></char></note>avantaj pou sila ki konn wè solèy yo. <verse eid="ECC 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 7:12" />Paske sajès se yon pwotèj, menm ke lajan se yon pwotèj la; men avantaj a bon konprann nan se ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:18">Pwov 3:18</ref></char></note>sajès va prezève lavi a sila ki genyen l.<verse eid="ECC 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 7:13" />Konsidere zèv Bondye yo, paske se kilès ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 1:15">Ekl 1:15</ref></char></note>ka drese sa ke Li menm te koube? <verse eid="ECC 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 7:14" />Nan jou bonè yo fè kè kontan; men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:5">Det 8:5</ref></char></note>nan jou malè yo, reflechi—Bondye te fè tou de pou lòm pa dekouvri anyen nan sa k ap swiv li.<verse eid="ECC 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 7:15" />Mwen te wè tout bagay pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 6:12">Ekl 6:12</ref></char></note>tout jou vanite mwen yo; gen yon nonm dwat ki mouri nan ladwati, ak yon nonm mechan ki fè vi li long ak mechanste li a. <verse eid="ECC 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 7:16" />Pa fè eksè nan ladwati, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:3">Wo 12:3</ref></char></note>ni pa vin twò saj. Poukisa ou ta detwi pwòp tèt ou? <verse eid="ECC 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 7:17" />Pa fè eksè nan mechanste, ni pa vin ensanse. Poukisa ou ta vle <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:16">Job 22:16</ref></char></note>mouri avan lè ou? <verse eid="ECC 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 7:18" />Li bon pou ou ta kenbe pran yon bagay san ou pa lage lòt la; paske sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:14">Ekl 3:14</ref></char></note>gen lakrent Bondye a ap vini ak tou de. <verse eid="ECC 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 7:19" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 7:12">Ekl 7:12</ref></char></note>Sajès ranfòse yon nonm saj plis pase dis gwo chèf ki nan yon vil. <verse eid="ECC 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 7:20" />Anverite, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:46">I Wa 8:46</ref></char></note>nanpwen yon moun dwat sou latè ki fè sa ki bon tout tan, e ki pa janm peche. <verse eid="ECC 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 7:21" />Anplis, pa pran a kè tout pawòl ki pale, sof ke ou ta tande sèvitè ou lè l ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 30:10">Pwov 30:10</ref></char></note>bay ou madichon. <verse eid="ECC 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 7:22" />Paske ou vin konprann ke ou menm tou anpil fwa konn bay moun madichon. <verse eid="ECC 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 7:23" />Mwen te tante fè tout sa ak sajès e mwen te di: “Mwen va saj”, men sa te chape lwen mwen. <verse eid="ECC 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 7:24" />Sa ki te konn egziste vin lwen, e se yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:33">Wo 11:33</ref></char></note>mistè menm. Se kilès ki ka dekouvri li? <verse eid="ECC 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 7:25" />Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 1:15-17">Ekl 1:15-17</ref></char></note>dirije panse m pou konnen; pou fè ankèt e chache sajès avèk rezon, e pou konnen mechanste se foli; e foli menm rive fè moun fou.<verse eid="ECC 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 7:26" />Epi mwen te dekouvri pi anmè pase mouri, kè a fanm ki fè pèlen an. Men li yo se tankou chenn. Yon moun ki plè Bondye va chape anba men l, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 22:14">Pwov 22:14</ref> </char></note>pechè a va vin kaptire anba l.<verse eid="ECC 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ECC 7:27" />“Gade byen, se sa mwen dekouvri,” predikatè a di: “Ajoute yon bagay a yon lòt pou twouve konprann.” <verse eid="ECC 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ECC 7:28" />Sou sila m toujou ap chache a, men m poko jwenn; mwen te twouve yon nonm pami mil, men mwen pa t jwenn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:3">I Wa 11:3</ref></char></note>fanm pami tout sa yo. <verse eid="ECC 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ECC 7:29" />Men gade, se sèl sa mwen dekouvri; Bondye te fè lòm kanpe dwat, men yo chache anpil manèv pou vin koube.<verse eid="ECC 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ECC 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 8:1" />Se kilès ki tankou nonm saj ki konnen sans a yon bagay? Sajès a yon nonm klere li e fè vizaj sevè li a vin briye.<verse eid="ECC 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 8:2" />Mwen di: “Swiv lòd wa a akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:11">Egz 22:11</ref></char></note>sèman ki te fèt devan Bondye a. <verse eid="ECC 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 8:3" />Pa prese <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 10:4">Ekl 10:4</ref></char></note>abandone lòd li. Pa jwenn ou menm nan yon move konbinezon, paske l ap fè nenpòt sa ki fè li plezi.” <verse eid="ECC 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 8:4" />Akoz pawòl a wa a pote otorite, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:12">Job 9:12</ref></char></note>se kilès ki va di l: “Kisa w ap fè la a?” <verse eid="ECC 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 8:5" />Sila ki swiv yon kòmand wayal pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 12:21">Pwov 12:21</ref></char></note>jwenn twoub; paske yon kè saj konnen tan ak mwayen ki bon pou aji. <verse eid="ECC 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 8:6" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:1-17">Ekl 3:1-17</ref></char></note>gen yon tan ak mwayen ki bon pou chak plezi, malgre pwoblèm moun an peze lou sou li. <verse eid="ECC 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 8:7" />Si pa gen pèsòn ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:22">Ekl 3:22</ref></char></note>konnen ki sa k ap vin rive, se kilès ki ka di li kilè li va rive. <verse eid="ECC 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 8:8" />Nanpwen moun ki ka sèvi ak van pou anpeche van, ni ki gen otorite sou jou lanmò a; epi pa gen lese tonbe ni kite nan tan lagè, ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 8:13">Ekl 8:13</ref></char></note>mal la kap fèt p ap delivre sila ki fè l yo.<verse eid="ECC 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 8:9" />Tout sa mwen konn wè yo, e kon aplike panse m a tout zèv ki te fèt anba solèy la, kote moun sèvi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 4:1">Ekl 4:1</ref></char></note>otorite l sou lòt pou fè mal la. <verse eid="ECC 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 8:10" />Konsa, mwen konn wè mechan yo antere, menm sila ki te konn antre sòti nan lye sen yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 1:11">Ekl 1:11</ref></char></note>ase vit yo vin bliye nèt nan menm vil kote yo te aji konsa a. Sa tou, se vanite. <verse eid="ECC 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 8:11" />Akoz jijman kont yon zak mechan pa rive ase vit; akoz sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 9:3">Ekl 9:3</ref></char></note>kè fis a lòm nan ki rete pami yo vin dedye nèt pou fè mal. <verse eid="ECC 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 8:12" />Malgre yon pechè fè mal san fwa e mennen yon vi ki long, mwen toujou konnen ke sa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:40">Det 4:40</ref></char></note>prale byen pou sila ki gen lakrent Bondye yo, ki gen lakrent devan L yo. <verse eid="ECC 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 8:13" />Men, sa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 8:8">Ekl 8:8</ref></char></note>pa prale byen pou moun mechan an, e li p ap pwolonje jou li yo tankou yon lonbraj, paske li pa gen lakrent Bondye.<verse eid="ECC 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 8:14" />Gen yon vanite ki fèt sou latè, sa vle di, gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 73:14">Sòm 73:14</ref></char></note>moun dwat ki vin viktim a mechan yo. Yon lòt kote, gen moun mechan an ki vin tonbe akoz zèv moun dwat yo. Mwen di sa anplis se vanite. <verse eid="ECC 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 8:15" />Pou sa, mwen te rekòmande plezi; paske, pa gen anyen pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:24">Ekl 2:24</ref></char></note>yon nonm anba solèy la fè sof ke manje, bwè, e fè plezi; epi sa va fè l kanpe nan travay di li diran tout jou lavi, ke Bondye te bay li anba solèy la.<verse eid="ECC 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 8:16" />Lè mwen te bay kè m pou aprann sajès ak pou m wè tach ki te konn fèt sou tè a, (malgre sa ta fè yon moun pa janm dòmi ni lajounen, ni lannwit), <verse eid="ECC 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 8:17" />konsa, lè mwen te wè tout zèv Bondye te fè, mwen te vin aprann ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:11">Ekl 3:11</ref></char></note>lòm p ap kapab dekouvri travay ki te konn fèt anba syèl la. Malgre lòm ta chache ak tout dilijans, li p ap twouve li. Malgre yon nonm saj ta di: “Mwen konnen”, li p ap ka dekouvri li.<verse eid="ECC 8:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ECC 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 9:1" />Paske, tout sa mwen te pote kon fado nan kè m pou eksplike li; ke moun dwat yo, moun saj yo, avèk tout zèv yo nan men Bondye. Lòm pa konnen si se lanmou, oswa rayisman; nenpòt bagay kapab tann li. <verse eid="ECC 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 9:2" />Se menm bagay la pou tout moun. Gen yon sèl desten pou moun dwat yo ak mechan yo; pou bon an, pou moun san tach la, ak pou enpi a; pou sila ki ofri sakrifis ak sila ki pa ofri sakrifis la. Tankou sila ki dwat ak pechè a menm jan; tankou sila ki fè sèman an, se konsa sila ki refize sèmante a ye. <verse eid="ECC 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 9:3" />Men yon mal nan tout sa ki konn fèt anba solèy la, ke gen menm desten an pou tout moun. Anplis, kè a fis a lòm yo plen mechanste, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 1:17">Ekl 1:17</ref> </char></note>foli rete nan kè yo pandan tout lavi yo. Apre, yo ale kote mò yo. <verse eid="ECC 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 9:4" />Paske, nenpòt moun ki jwenn ansanm ak lòt vivan yo gen espwa; anverite, yon chen vivan pi bon pase yon lyon ki mouri. <verse eid="ECC 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 9:5" />Paske vivan yo konnen ke y ap mouri; men mò yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 14:21">Job 14:21</ref></char></note>pa konnen anyen; ni yo pa jwenn rekonpans ankò, paske memwa yo fin bliye nèt. <verse eid="ECC 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 9:6" />Anverite, lanmou yo, rayisman yo, ak fòs kouraj yo deja fin mouri, e yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:10">Ekl 2:10</ref></char></note>pa gen pati ankò nan tout sa ki fèt anba solèy la.<verse eid="ECC 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 9:7" />Ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:24">Ekl 2:24</ref></char></note>manje pen ou ak kè kontan e bwè diven ak kè plen ak jwa; paske Bondye deja pran plezi nan sa ou fè a. <verse eid="ECC 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 9:8" />Kite tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:4">Rev 3:4</ref></char></note>vètman ou yo rete blan tout tan, e pa kite lwil la manke sou tèt ou. <verse eid="ECC 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 9:9" />Fè rejwisans lavi ou ak fanm ke ou renmen pandan tout jou kout lavi ou ke Li te bay ou anba solèy la. Paske sa se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:10">Ekl 2:10</ref></char></note>rekonpans ou nan lavi ak nan travay di ou konn fè anba solèy la. <verse eid="ECC 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 9:10" />Nenpòt sa ke men ou jwenn pou fè, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 11:6">Ekl 11:6</ref></char></note>fè l ak tout kouraj ou. Paske pa gen aktivite, ni plan, ni konesans, ni sajès nan Sejou mò kote ou prale a.<verse eid="ECC 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 9:11" />Anplis, mwen te wè anba solèy la ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 2:14">Am 2:14</ref></char></note>kous la pa pou moun ki rapid la, ni batay la pa pou gwo gèrye yo, ni pen pou saj la, ni richès a sila ki byen konprann nan, ni favè a moun abil; paske tan avèk jan tout bagay dewoule vin genyen yo tout. <verse eid="ECC 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 9:12" />Anplis, lòm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:34-35">Luc 21:34-35</ref></char></note>pa konnen lè li tankou pwason ki kenbe nan yon filè mechan an, o zwazo ki kenbe nan pèlen an. Se konsa fis a lòm yo sezi nan yon move moman. Epi lanmò an tonbe sou yo sibitman.<verse eid="ECC 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 9:13" />Sa osi, mwen te vin konprann kon sajès anba solèy la, e li te etone panse m. <verse eid="ECC 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 9:14" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 20:16-22">II Sam 20:16-22</ref></char></note>Te gen yon ti vil ak kèk grenn moun ladann. Yon gran wa te parèt sou li, te antoure li, e te konstwi zam syèj kont li. <verse eid="ECC 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 9:15" />Men te twouve ladann yon malere byen saj; li te delivre vil la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 20:16-22">II Sam 20:16-22</ref> </char></note>avèk sajès li. Men pa t gen pèsòn ki te sonje moun malere sila a. <verse eid="ECC 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 9:16" />Konsa mwen te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 21:22">Pwov 21:22</ref></char></note>“Sajès pi bon pase pwisans.” Men sajès a malere a meprize, e pou pawòl li, pèsòn pa tande yo. <verse eid="ECC 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 9:17" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 7:5">Ekl 7:5</ref></char></note>Pawòl a saj k ap koute lè tout bagay kalm pi bon pase vwa chèf k ap rele fò nan mitan moun ensanse. <verse eid="ECC 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 9:18" />Sajès pi bon ke zam lagè; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:1-26">Jos 7:1-26</ref></char></note>men yon sèl pechè detwi anpil ki bon.<verse eid="ECC 9:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ECC 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 10:1" />Mouch mouri bay</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:1">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 30:25">Egz 30:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>lwil pafen yon move odè;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:1">Se konsa yon ti kras foli gen pouvwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:1">pou depase sajès ak respè.<verse eid="ECC 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 10:2" />Kè a yon moun saj mennen li adwat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:2">men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:33">Mat 6:33</ref></char></note>kè a moun san konprann nan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:2">mennen l agoch.<verse eid="ECC 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 10:3" />Menm lè ensanse a mache nan lari</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:3">li manke bon tèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:3">Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 13:16">Pwov 13:16</ref></char></note>montre tout moun ke</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:3">se moun fou li ye.<verse eid="ECC 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 10:4" />Si kòlè a wa a vin monte kont ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:4">pa abandone pozisyon ou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:4">paske rete kalm ka evite gwo ofans.<verse eid="ECC 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 10:5" />Gen yon mal mwen konn wè anba solèy la, tankou yon fot ki sòti nan sila k ap gouvène a—— <verse eid="ECC 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 10:6" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:1-5">Est 3:1-5</ref></char></note>Foli plase nan anpil kote byen wo pandan rich yo chita kote ki ba. <verse eid="ECC 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 10:7" />Mwen konn wè esklav ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 6:8-10">Est 6:8-10</ref></char></note>monte sou cheval ak prens k ap mache atè tankou esklav. <verse eid="ECC 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 10:8" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 7:15">Sòm 7:15</ref></char></note>Sila ki fouye fè yon twou ka byen tonbe ladann, e yon sèpan ka mòde gèrye a ki kraze yon miray. <verse eid="ECC 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 10:9" />Sila ki taye wòch yo ka blese ladann, e sila ki fann gwo bout bwa a kapab an danje. <verse eid="ECC 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 10:10" />Si rach la pa gen tay, e li pa file pwent li; alò, li va egzije plis fòs. Avantaj a sajès se reyisi!<verse eid="ECC 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 10:11" />Si sèpan an mòde <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 58:4-5">Sòm 58:4-5</ref></char></note>avan li vin chame, nanpwen pwofi. <verse eid="ECC 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 10:12" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:32">Pwov 10:32</ref></char></note>Pawòl ki soti nan bouch sila ki saj la plen ak gras, men pawòl a moun ensanse a fin manje l nèt; <verse eid="ECC 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 10:13" />Kòmansman diskou ensanse a se foli, e fen diskou li se plen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 7:25">Ekl 7:25</ref></char></note>mechanste ak betiz. <verse eid="ECC 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 10:14" />Malgre tout sa, moun ensanse a ogmante pawòl li yo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ECC 10:14">Pèsòn pa konnen sa ki va rive, e kilès kab di li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:22">Ekl 3:22</ref></char></note>sa ki va rive apre li. <verse eid="ECC 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 10:15" />Zèv a moun ensanse a tèlman fatige l, ke li pa konnen kijan pou li rive nan vil la.<verse eid="ECC 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 10:16" />Malè a ou menm, O peyi ki gen jenn ti gason kon wa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:16">ak prens yo k ap fè fèt granmaten.<verse eid="ECC 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 10:17" />Beni se ou menm, O peyi ki gen yon fis byen prepare kon wa a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:17">ak prens ki manje nan pwòp lè yo, pou bay fòs,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:17">e non pou fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 31:4">Pwov 31:4</ref></char></note>banbòch vin sou.<verse eid="ECC 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 10:18" />Akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 24:30-34">Pwov 24:30-34</ref></char></note>parès ak neglijans, twati a vin pann,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:18">e nan enpridans kay la vin koule.<verse eid="ECC 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 10:19" />Yon gwo tab manje fèt pou yo rejwi yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:19">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 9:13">Jij 9:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>diven pou fè kè kontan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:19">epi lajan se repons pou tout bagay.<verse eid="ECC 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 10:20" />Anplis, nan chanm a kouche ou, pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:28">Egz 22:28</ref></char></note>bay wa a madichon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:20">e nan chanm a kouche ou, pa bay yon moun rich madichon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:20">Paske yon zwazo syèl la ka pote bri a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 10:20">e sa ki gen zèl yo ka fè yo konnen bagay la.<verse eid="ECC 10:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ECC 11" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 11:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 15:10">Det 15:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Voye pen ou sou sifas dlo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:1">e apre anpil jou, ou va twouve l.<verse eid="ECC 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 11:2" />Divize byen ou fè sèt, oswa uit menm;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:2">paske ou pa janm konnen ki malè k ap rive sou latè.<verse eid="ECC 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 11:3" />Si nwaj yo plen, yo vide lapli sou latè;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:3">epi si yon bwa tonbe vè sid, oswa vè nò,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:3">kote li tonbe a, se la l ap kouche.<verse eid="ECC 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 11:4" />Sila ke veye van an p ap simen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:4">ni sila ki veye syèl la p ap rekòlte.<verse eid="ECC 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 11:5" />Menm jan ke ou pa konnen chemen van an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:5">ni jan zo yo vin fòme nan vant a fanm ansent lan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:5">se konsa ou pa konnen zèv Bondye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:5">ki fè tout bagay la.<verse eid="ECC 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 11:6" />Simen semans ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 9:10">Ekl 9:10</ref></char></note>nan maten an;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:6">ni pa gaspiye tan nan aswè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:6">Paske ou pa janm konnen si se nan maten</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:6">oswa nan aswè semans lan ap reyisi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:6">ni si se pa tou de k ap bon.<verse eid="ECC 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 11:7" />Limyè a byen bèl,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:7">e li bon pou zye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 6:5">Ekl 6:5</ref></char></note>wè solèy la.<verse eid="ECC 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 11:8" />Anverite, si yon nonm ta viv anpil ane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:8">kite li rejwi li nan yo tout;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:8">men pa kite l bliye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 12:1">Ekl 12:1</ref></char></note>jou tenèb yo, paske yo va anpil.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:8">Tout sa ki gen pou vini se vanite.<verse eid="ECC 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 11:9" />Rejwi jennonm, pandan jenès ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:9">e kite kè ou rete kontan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:9">pandan ane de laj jenès ou yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:9">Swiv sa ki atire kè ou ak dezi a zye ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:9">men konnen byen ke Bondye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:9">va rele ou nan jijman pou tout bagay sa yo.<verse eid="ECC 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 11:10" />Pou sa, retire gwo doulè ak mechanste</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:10">pou l pa nan kè ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:10">e fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 7:1">II Kor 7:1</ref></char></note>mal rete lwen chè ou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 11:10">paske jenès ak ane jenès yo va disparèt vit.<verse eid="ECC 11:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ECC 12" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 12:1" />Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:18">Det 8:18</ref></char></note>sonje Kreyatè ou a nan jou jenès ou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:1">avan move jou yo rive e ane yo pwoche lè ou va di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:1">“Mwen pa pran plezi nan yo;”<verse eid="ECC 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 12:2" />Avan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:30">És 5:30</ref></char></note>solèy la ak limyè a, lalin nan ak zetwal yo vin tounwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:2">e nwaj yo retounen apre lapli yo;<verse eid="ECC 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 12:3" />nan jou ke gadyen kay la tranble a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:3">e mesye pwisan yo vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:14">Sòm 35:14</ref></char></note>koube a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:3">Lè sa yo k ap moule a rete san travay</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:3">akoz anpil nan yo ki manke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:3">e sila k ap gade nan fenèt yo vin mal pou wè.<verse eid="ECC 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 12:4" />Lè pòt vè lari yo vin fèmen akoz bri moulen an vin ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:4">e yon moun va leve ak son zwazo a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:4">epi tout fi chanson yo va rete ba.<verse eid="ECC 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 12:5" />Anplis mesye yo va vin pè yon wo plas</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:5">ak gwo danje k ap vini a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:5">Lè pye zanmann nan fleri, krikèt volan rale kò l olon wout la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:5">e dezi gason an pa ka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:5">Paske lòm nan ap prale nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 17:3">Job 17:3</ref></char></note>kay etènèl li a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:5">pandan sila k ap fè dèy yo vire toupatou nan wout la.<verse eid="ECC 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 12:6" />Sonje Li avan kòd ajan an kase,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:6">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 4:2-3">Za 4:2-3</ref></char></note>bòl an lò a kraze kivèt dlo la kote pwi a vin fann,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:6">e wou sitèn nan vin kraze.<verse eid="ECC 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 12:7" />Paske konsa pousyè la va retounen nan tè a jan li te ye a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 12:7">e lespri a va retounen kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:22">Nonb 16:22</ref> </char></note>Bondye ki te bay li a.<verse eid="ECC 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 12:8" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 1:2">Ekl 1:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Vanite sou vanite”, predikatè a di: “tout se vanite!”<verse eid="ECC 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 12:9" />Anplis akoz li te yon nonm saj, predikatè a te enstwi pèp la ak konesans. Wi, li te reflechi, chache twouve, e te aranje <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:32">I Wa 4:32</ref></char></note>anpil pwovèb. <verse eid="ECC 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 12:10" />Predikatè a te chache jwenn bèl mò pou ekri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 22:20">Pwov 22:20</ref></char></note>pawòl verite yo byen kòrèk. <verse eid="ECC 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 12:11" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:37">Trav 2:37</ref></char></note>Pawòl a moun saj yo tankou pwent pike bèt yo ye; tankou klou ki kloure nèt, se konsa ansanm a pawòl sila yo ye. Se yon sèl Bèje ki bay yo tout.<verse eid="ECC 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 12:12" />Men anplis ke sa, fis mwen, veye byen: ekri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:32">I Wa 4:32</ref></char></note>anpil liv se yon bagay san rete, e anpil devosyon a liv yo va fatige kò ou. <verse eid="ECC 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 12:13" />Konklizyon lè tout bagay fin tande se: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:14">Ekl 3:14</ref></char></note>Gen lakrent Bondye e kenbe kòmandman li yo, akoz se sa ki aplike a tout moun. <verse eid="ECC 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 12:14" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:17">Ekl 3:17</ref></char></note>Bondye va pote tout zèv nan jijman; tout sa ki kache, kit li bon kit li mal.<verse eid="ECC 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 12" />
</usx>